 from a scrapyard in Vancouver to the Orthodox Jewish community of Bnei Brak and back to a decaying farm in rural Manitoba. Each discovery adds to the visual and narrative collage, building to a surprising and thought-provoking conclusion that invites us to explore our own personal stories.   ", "short_description": "Blood Relations is a whimsical VR documentary about an adopted child and a quest to solve an ancestral mystery."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "BloodRelations_KeyArt-Portrait1008x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "3185431641772787", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974676_3185431645106120_7305487962040821417_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=TIEQlqnvBhoQ7kNvwFcYxMV&_nc_oc=Adp4aPSN4OWBZ4OqwVLXvB4ngwKu3o8ZQjxyhJUcaG8_qCrKgX336UqRuO46aqD0bgY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQFedsZ6mT2K6gQ1UQDd-jWASnmXLMq01UkxGnKPUdCj5w&oe=6A7C5681"}, {"file_name": "BloodRelations_TrCoverImage2560x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "2112431928963685", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974453_2112431932297018_1168886450594301820_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=8bnIg6wPJ0AQ7kNvwEeoBUK&_nc_oc=Adr-nxfS9c-UcyNK9grBlQD98HC_w2PAh2CeSCq5eGqTaNpUdutVEtUc1r5CxKRFljo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGYqcv68ljO8Nhq5QFkru459eNAxJFGzztXM1fIxvaUMw&oe=6A7C63E6"}, {"file_name": "BloodRelations_KeyArt-Square1440x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "1965493300326997", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75262745_1965493303660330_6562698748019357103_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=S4XszIEd-IMQ7kNvwGUTcvS&_nc_oc=AdrAx20k08ttvO-hVyRIoYFK6oMsXzjojZQgRons0bl1_As_Y2-3ZteTvoyn_G2WqB8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGDvmQRYJH9h7yg3qfVjxb5gw_jUo_KYXhDs3q0_Z6tEw&oe=6A7C6DDC"}, {"fil